This project contains educational material, experimental configurations, scripts, and documentation for studying computer networking and security protocols.

The experiments in this project may use, depend on, or interact with third-party software and technologies, including but not limited to:

OpenSSL
OpenSSH
Linux
Docker
GNS3
Wireshark
BIND 9 (including dig, rndc, nsupdate, and DNSSEC tools)
Unbound
dnsdist
Dnsmasq
Snort
Scapy
Python (including Paramiko and Flask)
iptables / Netfilter
Firefox
NGINX
curl
Cisco IOS / IOSvL2 (proprietary)
